  "body": "The fix for #95 leaves \"AppCache\" slightly broken based on the expectation that it will be removed. If removing \"AppCache\" is no longer likely a year and a bit from now we should reevaluate and consider defining \"AppCache\" properly in terms of Fetch. (And move parts of the processing model into Fetch, most likely.)\n",
